{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Cosmos Milk Tea</strong>, a narrative adventure and simulation game born from AI-native design.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set aboard a space station, you play as Lily \u2014 milk tea maker by day, bartender by night. Serve drinks, chat with AI-powered customers who each have unique personalities and memories. Your conversations aren\u2019t scripted \u2014 they're dynamic, personal, and can shape the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As bonds grow, you\u2019ll unlock new recipes and uncover hidden truths about the universe, artificial intelligence\u2026 and yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AI-Driven Characters</strong>: Talk freely with intelligent NPCs who remember, react, and evolve.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Day &amp; Night Gameplay</strong>: Manage your caf\u00e9 by day, connect deeply by night.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creative Drink System</strong>: Mix ingredients to craft unique cosmic milk teas.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2800000?t=1755900307","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2800000?t=1755900307","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2800000/66e7755b26aff02160d3abafffb3f51449943256/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755900307","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2800000/66e7755b26aff02160d3abafffb3f51449943256/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755900307","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Cosmos Milk Tea</str